SpadeIDE for Debian / Ubuntu
============================

One command:

  spadeide              start if needed, show QR + pair URL
  spadeide status       paired / online tablets
  spadeide stop
  spadeide reset        forget paired devices

Several tablets can stay paired. Each bare `spadeide` run issues a fresh
pair secret for a new iPad.

  sudo apt install ./spadeide_*.deb
  spadeide

LAN discovery (IP changes): sudo apt install avahi-daemon avahi-utils

Do not run as root.
